OL,3,AWhy tiny cars are taking off across    
OL,4,AEurope                                 
OL,6,FIn France, you can drive a car like    
OL,7,Fthis from the age of 14 with a road    
OL,8,Fsafety certificate and eight hours     
OL,9,Ftraining. In Italy too.                
OL,11,FIn Germany and Spain it's 15, in the UK
OL,12,F16. Because they are classed as        
OL,13,Fmotorised quadri-cycles. Four-wheel    
OL,14,Fmopeds in other words.                 
